The '''Bingbow''' is an {{Epic}} [[Bow]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingbow''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Bow
|rarity = epic
|damage = 210
|strength = 100
|special_effect = Your arrows have a {{Yellow|20%}} chance to bounce to another target after it hits something. {{Dark Gray|(max 2 bounces)}}
}}
The '''Bingbow''' is a shortbow, meaning it can fire arrows instantly, without needing to charge. The maximum rate of fire is determined by the player's {{Stat|Attack Speed}}.

